steps.body:
The radii point up, lower-left and lower-right, and the diagonals meet the circle at upper-left, upper-right, lower-left and lower-right. So the arc of
- the **top** trapezoid contains the upward radius → touches UL and UR;
- the **left** trapezoid contains the lower-left radius → touches UL and Bt;
- the **right** trapezoid contains the lower-right radius → touches UR and Bt;
- the **bottom** trapezoid touches only Bt.

Neighbouring trapezoids also share a diagonal edge (top–left, top–right, left–bottom, right–bottom).
